### ============================================================
### 37-SpringAuthServer OAuth2 & OIDC Provider API Testing (Port: 8137)
### ============================================================

### 1. OpenID Connect Discovery Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8137/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

### 2. OAuth2 Authorization Server Metadata
GET http://localhost:8137/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
Accept: application/json

### 3. JWK Set Endpoint (Lấy Public Key dùng để xác minh chữ ký JWT Token)
GET http://localhost:8137/oauth2/jwks
Accept: application/json

### 4. Cấp Access Token bằng Client Credentials Flow (messaging-client / secret)
POST http://localhost:8137/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic bWVzc2FnaW5nLWNsaWVudDpzZWNyZXQ=
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=message.read
